hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1496","Muhammad bin Yahya told us, Yazid bin Harun told us, and Abdah bin Abdullah Al-Khuza’i told us, Yazid bin Harun told us, Muhammad bin Mutarrif told us, on the authority of Zayd bin Aslam, on the authority of Ata’ bin Yasar, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said And he said: “Whoever goes to the mosque tomorrow or goes, God will prepare for him an abode in Paradise whenever he goes in the morning or goes.”"
